      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought we were pursuing a separate kernel module for this? This introduces a lot of coupling to the internal bpf code, and could become a nightmare to maintain.\n\nAlso we need to discuss if we will be targeting android-mainline for this. We try to keep as much as possible out of mainline to ease syncing with upstream.",
      "revId": "8cf7919199deb58fd68fc155b49f5024d5f1c32f",
